{"narration": "¿Sabes qué mira un mecánico en los primeros diez segundos que llegas al taller? No es el motor. Primero, la cadena: si cuelga mucho, ya te está robando fuerza. Segundo, las llantas: un borde gastado delata cómo frenas. Tercero, el humo del escape: si sale azul, está quemando aceite. Y lo último… cómo suena en mínimo. ¿Tu moto pasaría la prueba? Escríbenos y la revisamos.", "words": [["¿Sabes", 0.08, 0.372], ["qué", 0.372, 0.576], ["mira", 0.576, 0.824], ["un", 0.824, 0.984], ["mecánico", 0.984, 1.409], ["en", 1.409, 1.569], ["los", 1.569, 1.772], ["primeros", 1.772, 2.198], ["diez", 2.198, 2.446], ["segundos", 2.446, 2.871], ["que", 2.871, 3.075], ["llegas", 3.075, 3.411], ["al", 3.411, 3.571], ["taller?", 3.571, 3.908], ["No", 4.747, 4.947], ["es", 4.947, 5.147], ["el", 5.147, 5.347], ["motor.", 5.347, 5.714], ["Primero,", 6.663, 7.318], ["la", 7.486, 7.761], ["cadena:", 7.761, 8.34], ["si", 8.645, 8.92], ["cuelga", 8.92, 9.5], ["mucho,", 9.5, 10.003], ["ya", 10.171, 10.445], ["te", 10.445, 10.72], ["está", 10.72, 11.147], ["robando", 11.147, 11.803], ["fuerza.", 11.803, 12.383], ["Segundo,", 13.179, 13.84], ["las", 14.009, 14.363], ["llantas:", 14.363, 15.025], ["un", 15.332, 15.609], ["borde", 15.609, 16.117], ["gastado", 16.117, 16.779], ["delata", 16.779, 17.363], ["cómo", 17.363, 17.794], ["frenas.", 17.794, 18.379], ["Tercero,", 19.17, 19.785], ["el", 19.943, 20.2], ["humo", 20.2, 20.601], ["del", 20.601, 20.93], ["escape:", 20.93, 21.474], ["si", 21.761, 22.018], ["sale", 22.018, 22.419], ["azul,", 22.419, 22.82], ["está", 22.978, 23.378], ["quemando", 23.378, 24.066], ["aceite.", 24.066, 24.61], ["Y", 25.206, 25.492], ["lo", 25.492, 25.888], ["último…", 25.888, 26.726], ["cómo", 27.482, 28.037], ["suena", 28.037, 28.692], ["en", 28.692, 29.05], ["mínimo.", 29.05, 29.804], ["¿Tu", 30.461, 30.876], ["moto", 30.876, 31.521], ["pasaría", 31.521, 32.512], ["la", 32.512, 32.927], ["prueba?", 32.927, 33.802], ["Escríbenos", 34.817, 36.631], ["y", 36